_discovered_symbols` as the broader passive discovery universe from Binance Futures, CoinAnk, CoinAPI, KuCoin, and future ingestors. Expose selected `training_symbols` and `paper_symbols` as subsets chosen by evidence, not as all discovered symbols. Expose `live_symbols` as an empty list while live remains `blocked_human_only`, and keep `live_blocked_symbols` explicit. Workers must not train or trade all discovered symbols automatically. Candidate scoring must cite liquidity, volume, volatility, funding, open interest, spread, freshness, feature completeness, exchange availability, risk profile, model confidence, replay performance, and operator overrides. CoinAnk-only symbols remain market-intelligence candidates until Binance USD-M tradability is confirmed.",
